						</div><p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-600 lg:mt-0">
							Ofrecemos asesoramiento legal integral en las principales áreas del derecho, con un
							equipo especializado comprometido con la excelencia y los resultados.
						</p>
					</div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5">
						<div class="group cursor-pointer">
							<div class="relative mb-8">
								<div class="h-64 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-t-3xl">
									<img
										alt="Derecho Civil"
										class="h-full w-full object-cover object-top transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
										src="https://readdy.ai/api/search-image?query=professional%20legal%20document%20signing%20scene%20with%20elegant%20hands%20and%20contract%20papers%20on%20wooden%20desk%2C%20soft%20natural%20lighting%2C%20clean%20minimalist%20background%20emphasizing%20civil%20law%20and%20legal%20agreements&width=400&height=500&seq=civil-law-area&orientation=portrait"
									/>
								</div><div
									class="absolute -bottom-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 transform rounded-full px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold whitespace-nowrap text-white"
									style="background-color: rgb(20, 184, 166);"
								>
									Derecho Civil
								</div>
							</div><div class="px-4">
								<h3 class="mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Derecho Civil</h3><ul
									class="space-y-3"
								>
									<li class="flex items-start text-sm text-gray-600">
										<i
											class="ri-check-line mr-2 flex-shrink-0 text-lg"
											style="color: rgb(212, 175, 55);"></i><span>Contratos y obligaciones</span>
									</li><li class="flex items-start text-sm text-gray-600">
										<i
											class="ri-check-line mr-2 flex-shrink-0 text-lg"
											style="color: rgb(212, 175, 55);"></i><span>Responsabilidad civil</span>
									</li><li class="flex items-start text-sm text-gray-600">
										<i
											class="ri-check-line mr-2 flex-shrink-0 text-lg"
											style="color: rgb(212, 175, 55);"></i><span>Derecho inmobiliario</span>
									</li><li class="flex items-start text-sm text-gray-600">
										<i
											class="ri-check-line mr-2 flex-shrink-0 text-lg"
											style="color: rgb(212, 175, 55);"></i><span>Sucesiones y herencias</span>
									</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
						</div><div class="group cursor-pointer">
							<div class="relative mb-8">
								<div class="h-64 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-t-3xl">
