								>
									Derecho Penal
								</div>
							</div><div class="px-4">
								<h3 class="mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Derecho Penal</h3><ul
									class="space-y-3"
								>
									<li class="flex items-start text-sm text-gray-600">
										<i
											class="ri-check-line mr-2 flex-shrink-0 text-lg"
											style="color: rgb(212, 175, 55);"></i><span>Defensa penal</span>
									</li><li class="flex items-start text-sm text-gray-600">
										<i
											class="ri-check-line mr-2 flex-shrink-0 text-lg"
											style="color: rgb(212, 175, 55);"></i><span>Delitos económicos</span>
									</li><li class="flex items-start text-sm text-gray-600">
										<i
											class="ri-check-line mr-2 flex-shrink-0 text-lg"
